TITLE Equilibrium oxidation of pyrite in pure water with atmospheric O2; allow goethite and gypsum
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)  -0.7  10
    Pyrite 0.0   0.1
    Goethite 0.0 0
    Gypsum   0.0 0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file pyrite_ox.sel
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -totals Fe S Ca
    -si Pyrite Goethite Gypsum
USER_PUNCH
    -headings SpCond_uS_cm
10 PUNCH SC
END
